  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> [parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></math> plane]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> [parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></math> plane]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\">